1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:02,515
97 ta layk! Haydovchimiz aniqlandi!

2
00:00:02,515 --> 00:00:06,301
ZAMIN FK avtobusining yangi virtual haydovchisi — Odilbek!

3
00:00:06,621 --> 00:00:07,819
Odilbek, tabriklaymiz!

4
00:00:07,819 --> 00:00:10,106
Sizni jamoamiz Toshkent safarida kutmoqda!

5
00:00:10,426 --> 00:00:13,001
Bu orada videomiz 118 ta layk oldi!

6
00:00:13,001 --> 00:00:16,166
Klub fondiga yana 1 770 000 so‘m qo‘shildi!

7
00:00:16,166 --> 00:00:19,109
Jami virtual fondimiz — 23 460 000 so‘m!

8
00:00:19,429 --> 00:00:21,639
Lekin eng katta yangilik hali oldinda!

9
00:00:21,639 --> 00:00:24,023
ZAMIN FK Andijondan haqiqiy hamkor topdi!

10
00:00:24,023 --> 00:00:26,989
Klubimizda katta o‘zgarishlar boshlanish arafasida!

11
00:00:27,309 --> 00:00:30,083
Yana bir gap! Jamoamizga qo‘shilmoqchi bo‘lganlar ko‘p.

12
00:00:30,083 --> 00:00:32,858
Haqiqiy jamoamiz tarkibini ham tez orada e’lon qilamiz!

13
00:00:33,178 --> 00:00:34,305
Endi navbat sizda!

14
00:00:34,305 --> 00:00:37,375
Hamkorimiz bilan birinchi nimani rivojlantiramiz?

15
00:00:37,375 --> 00:00:38,377
1 — yangi forma!

16
00:00:38,377 --> 00:00:39,755
2 — mashg‘ulot bazasi!

17
00:00:39,755 --> 00:00:41,885
3 — yosh futbolchilar akademiyasi!

18
00:00:41,885 --> 00:00:43,639
Tanlovingizni izohga yozing!

19
00:00:43,639 --> 00:00:46,145
24 soatdan keyin g‘olibni e’lon qilamiz!

